/Title (1\) What is LangGraph? What problem does it aim to solve compared to a simple linear chain of LLM calls?  LangGraph is a graph-based orchestration framework for LLM workflows.  It solves the limitation of linear chains by supporting branching, looping, conditional logic, and shared state, enabling complex and dynamic AI pipelines.)
